OpenVerify face module (openverify-face)

This module is shipped separately from the OpenVerify core Android SDK
(openverify-sdk). The core SDK is licensed under the Apache License 2.0
and does not depend on this module.

This module's own code is licensed under the Apache License 2.0.


Dependency (adopted in Phase 10, Workflow 10E, on 2026-11-11)

  ONNX Runtime  (com.microsoft.onnxruntime:onnxruntime-android, 1.31.0)
                https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
                License: MIT

The module depends on ONNX Runtime by Maven coordinates. Its AAR holds none
of ONNX Runtime's code: an app that adds the module receives Microsoft's
official AAR, unmodified, through the module's POM.

ONNX Runtime's licence and its third-party notices, copied from the v1.31.0
tag (commit 402979ac1bef89dcd55add41eaa7277c407599eb), are in
licenses/onnxruntime/LICENSE.txt and licenses/onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt.
The AAR on Maven Central carries no third-party notices file of its own.


Eigen

ONNX Runtime's native library has Eigen compiled in. Eigen is licensed
under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, a file-level copyleft licence that
OpenVerify's licence rule does not list. A narrow, recorded exception was
granted on 2026-11-08 under the owner's delegation (Phase 10 owner item P2,
docs/plans/phase-10.plan.md, "Orchestrator decisions before Workflow 10A"):
Eigen, unmodified, as compiled into the official onnxruntime-android AAR,
only inside this optional artifact.

Source location of Eigen as ONNX Runtime 1.31.0 builds it (MPL-2.0, section
3.2(a)), from cmake/deps.txt at the v1.31.0 tag:
  https://github.com/eigen-mirror/eigen
  revision 1d8b82b0740839c0de7f1242a3585e3390ff5f33
  https://github.com/eigen-mirror/eigen/archive/1d8b82b0740839c0de7f1242a3585e3390ff5f33/eigen-1d8b82b0740839c0de7f1242a3585e3390ff5f33.zip
Upstream: https://gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen

The text of the MPL-2.0 is in licenses/onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt,
in Eigen's entry.


The face-detection model

The YuNet model (face_detection_yunet_2026may.onnx, MIT, OpenCV Zoo) is not
in this repository. It is fetched by scripts/fetch_models.py with a pinned
SHA-256 and reaches the artifact at build time. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md,
section 3, for its licence and for the terms of the WIDER FACE dataset it
was trained on.

Its licence text, as published by OpenCV Zoo at commit
47534e27c9851bb1128ccc0102f1145e27f23f98, and a notice of the training
data's terms are in licenses/yunet/LICENSE.txt and licenses/yunet/NOTICE.txt.
The AAR carries this file and the licenses/ directory among its assets, under
assets/openverify-face/.
